# Test fixtures are committed deliberately and must survive the blanket data-file
# ignores above. Without this, an asset added by someone who already had it locally
# is invisible to git, the suite passes on their machine, and fails on every clean
# clone - which is what happened to tests/assets/hopv15_example.data.
!tests/assets/**

**/results/*
**/lightning_logs/*